%% DEDAN Health — POST /api/analyze request flow
%% Shows the order of operations and the failure path for each gate.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant UI as Web Portal
    participant MW as Middleware
    participant R as /api/analyze
    participant V as Pydantic
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant P as Provider
    participant S as SafetyValidator
    participant T as Transformer

    U->>UI: Describe symptoms (+ optional image / voice)
    UI->>MW: POST /api/analyze
    MW->>MW: Rate limit (per client IP)

    alt Rate limit exceeded
        MW-->>UI: 429 RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED
    end

    MW->>R: Forward
    R->>V: Validate AnalyzeRequest
    alt Invalid body
        V-->>UI: 422 VALIDATION_ERROR
    end

    R->>R: Consent gate
    alt consent == false
        R-->>UI: 400 CONSENT_REQUIRED
    end

    R->>R: Assemble text, duration, severity, history
    R->>R: Resolve image_ids and decode base64 images
    R->>O: process(text, images, transcript, profile)
    O->>P: analyze_multimodal(request)

    alt Live provider selected
        P-->>O: AnalysisResponse (vendor-shaped)
    else Offline provider (default)
        P-->>O: AnalysisResponse (deterministic)
    end

    O->>S: validate_async(response, profile)
    S->>S: Red-flag / urgency / uncertainty checks
    S-->>O: SafetyCheckResult
    O->>S: apply_safety_result_async
    Note over S: Urgency is escalated,<br/>never downgraded

    O-->>R: AnalysisResponse
    R->>T: transform(result, clinical_context)
    T->>T: Build clinical context
    T->>T: Attach education + medication verification
    T-->>R: ClinicalResponse
    R-->>UI: 200 structured clinical document
    R-->>R: Background: write audit log entry
    UI-->>U: Render results + next steps + disclaimer
